<cl=A2A2A2>
Bandiers are not only flag bearers, but also experienced warriors-commanders of groups, capable of
to inspire fighters to great feats. Veterans of many battles, banders
they know perfectly well how to repel any attack, besides they have excellent health and
endurance. But not everyone can enter the guild, only true warriors who do not
spending their time practicing magic. Magic is forbidden in the guild, but even if
bandier tries to use a spell or powder, but nothing works for him.
<br><tab>
Guild members spend all their time studying battle tactics and their special skills
can dramatically change the course of the battle. If a bandier has a magic Banner, then he is capable of
transfer his power to his squad, at the call of the bandier, the squad members will gather around him, and under
his leadership organizes an impenetrable defense.
<br>
<br>
